&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Minimum 8-12 Years of experience handling offline and Digital&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience in handling Auto clients in top agencies is preferred&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;E-commerce and digital is musts have&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;MBA
- Marketing&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced and strategic media professional to join our team at an Associate Business Director / Business Director level.&amp;nbsp;The role requires a strong blend of client leadership, integrated digital strategy, business acumen, and team management capabilities.&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate will have a proven track record of managing large-scale digital mandates, driving business growth, leading integrated planning initiatives, and building strong client relationships. This role will be responsible for translating business challenges into media solutions that deliver measurable outcomes while driving innovation and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to client stakeholders, understanding business priorities and translating them into effective media strategies.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day client engagement, ensuring delivery excellence and long-term relationship growth.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive annual planning discussions, business reviews, and strategic roadmaps aligned to client objectives.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for business growth, upselling, and expansion of services.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Strategy &amp;amp; Integrated Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead the development of integrated digital media strategies across brand, performance, commerce, and audience-led initiatives.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build holistic media frameworks that align business objectives with consumer journeys and platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collaborate with specialist teams across search, social, programmatic, analytics, content, and measurement to deliver unified solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Champion innovation and emerging media opportunities that create competitive advantage for clients.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Governance &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Oversee planning and execution across biddable and non-biddable channels, ensuring quality, effectiveness, and compliance with agreed KPIs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive performance reviews and optimization frameworks across campaigns and business verticals.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ensure best-in-class campaign delivery through strong operational governance and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Leverage audience, platform, and business data to inform strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of advanced measurement frameworks including attribution, conversion lift, brand lift, MMM, and first-party data solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Partner with analytics and data science teams to unlock actionable insights and improve media effectiveness&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a high-performing team across planning, activation, analytics, and client servicing functions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of collaboration, accountability, innovation, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Support talent development, succession planning, and capability building within the team.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage account profitability, revenue forecasting, and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ensure financial discipline across planning, billing, and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Contribute to new business opportunities, pitches, and strategic growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;6
- 8 years of experience in digital media strategy, planning, and client leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital ecosystems including Search, Social, Programmatic, Video, Commerce, and Measurement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience managing large and complex client mandates across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead integrated media planning and business growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience managing account performance and profitability.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading and developing teams.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with data-driven planning, audience strategy, and advanced measurement frameworks is preferred.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong client satisfaction and relationship growth.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Delivery of innovative, business-first media solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Consistent achievement of campaign and business KPIs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Growth in account revenue and service adoption.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;High
- performing and engaged teams.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Recognition as a strategic partner internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment.&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;employees can tap into the global&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource&amp;nbsp;groups and host frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical,&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description – Influencer Marketing Client Servicing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Duties and

RESPONSIBILITIES:
&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ol&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Strategy &amp;amp; Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for assigned clients, managing day-to-day communication and expectations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understand client business objectives and translate them into influencer led marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop campaign roadmaps aligned to brand goals, target audiences, and platform trends.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influencer Campaign Planning &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Identify and evaluate relevant creators (regional, national, micro, macro, celebrity) based on brand needs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Oversee briefing, content approvals, and campaign rollouts across social platforms (Instagram, You Tube, X, etc.).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Research &amp;amp; Trendspotting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Stay updated with evolving creator economy trends, audience behaviors, and competitor campaigns.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Share insights with clients on category benchmarks and creative innovations in influencer marketing.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Measurement &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Define measurement frameworks (reach, engagement, brand lift, conversions) for each campaign.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Track performance in real-time, analyze results, and prepare actionable reports with learnings.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Recommend optimizations for future campaigns to maximize ROI.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Work with internal creative, media, and strategy teams to integrate influencer content with broader brand campaigns.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Support new business pitches by building influencer strategies, case studies, and mock campaign frameworks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Growth &amp;amp; Retention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to upsell or cross-sell influencer led solutions to existing clients.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build long-term trust with clients by positioning the agency as a strategic influencer partner.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/ol&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ol&gt; &lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in marketing/communications/business&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;4–7 years of experience in influencer marketing, branded content, or digital marketing (agency-side preferred).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of influencer ecosystem across platforms (Instagram, You Tube, Snapchat, X, Sharechat, Moj, etc.).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in managing influencer campaigns from strategy to execution.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with ability to track, interpret, and present campaign performance data.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Passion for digital culture, creators, and social-first storytelling.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple accounts/projects simultaneously and work in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for client meetings, influencer shoots, and industry events when required.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

