&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c2yi3x&quot; data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;231&quot;&gt;Lead the growth and development of Addressable TV solutions across the North region, driving adoption and strengthening market presence.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g2jt4z&quot; data-start=&quot;232&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;Develop and implement regional growth strategies aligned with business objectives and evolving client needs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m2h90o&quot; data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;Partner with clients and internal teams to design data-driven, audience-led advertising solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kne2eb&quot; data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;626&quot;&gt;Build and nurture strong relationships with key clients, agencies, broadcasters, and strategic partners to foster long-term collaboration.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bag9ub&quot; data-start=&quot;627&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;Identify new business opportunities while expanding existing client engagements through strategic planning and consultative partnerships.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10d1bpx&quot; data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including Strategy, Planning, Investment, and Product, to deliver integrated and innovative media solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sjha1k&quot; data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;1050&quot;&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, audience insights, and emerging technologies to shape the evolution of Addressable TV offerings.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ur55kp&quot; data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;Drive thought leadership by educating clients and stakeholders on the value and capabilities of Addressable TV and advanced advertising solutions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w6jv9m&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Monitor regional market performance, competitive landscape, and campaign effectiveness to identify opportunities for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11nlumo&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1503&quot;&gt;Contribute to the overall growth of the Addressable TV business by ensuring high standards of client servicing, solution delivery, and stakeholder engagement&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;7–10 years of experience in advertising, media sales, or digital media.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the media ecosystem with a passion for driving innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;Proven track record in business development and client relationship management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-IN&quot;&gt;A self-driven, entrepreneurial mindset with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;