Senior Director
- Ecommerce Partnership &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Drive platform capability, innovation, and adoption across commerce and retail media. This role sits at the intersection of platforms, strategy, product, and training- ensuring commerce teams are equipped, workflows are efficient, and new platform opportunities are scaled quickly across clients.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Standardize and automate platform planning workflows with product/tech teams; drive adoption of platform tools.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Investment Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop platform mix and investment guidelines; identify emerging platforms and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Track platform updates, launch pilots, and scale successful tests across clients.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive cross platforms best-practice sharing and case study dissemination.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Convert platform data into actionable insights and co-create POVs and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content-to-Commerce:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with creative teams on platform-first content strategies and listing best practices.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability &amp;amp; L&amp;amp;D:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and deliver platform training programs, maintain a central knowledge hub, and act as an internal platform expert.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;8+ years in commerce media, retail media, or platform strategy&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of key platforms (Amazon, Flipkart, Q-commerce, retail media)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience in capability building, innovation pilots, or product/platform strategy&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Structured thinker with strong stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;

ROLE:
Senior Director
- Ecommerce Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Lead development and adoption of commerce products, tools, and frameworks that improve planning, activation, measurement, and operational efficiency across clients. The role connects strategy, tech, data, and activation teams to build scalable product solutions for commerce growth.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Define roadmap and build commerce tools, dashboards, and planning frameworks aligned to client and commerce team needs.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive adoption of product solutions across teams and clients through training and structured rollout.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate products into planning, activation, and reporting workflows to improve efficiency and standardisation.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Measurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build measurement frameworks and reporting solutions that drive performance insights and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify gaps, test new product features, and scale successful solutions across clients.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with strategy, tech and client teams to ensure product relevance and impact.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partnerships-&lt;/strong&gt; Manage &amp;amp; evolve 3P Commerce tech partnerships.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;6-10 years in e-commerce, digital product, or commerce tech roles&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling tools, dashboards, or planning frameworks&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of marketplace, retail media, and D2C ecosystems&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Structured, solution-oriented, and comfortable working cross-functionally&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;