&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In 12 months:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Produce a significant and impactful body of work that directly contributes to and fulfills all key success criteria for both clients and the agency, while also meeting personal and team performance indicators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Complete the annual performance evaluation for all team members, share performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;feedback, and identify training needs for team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What your day job looks like at Mindshare:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide strategic direction and oversight for the development and execution of content campaigns across digital, social, experiential, and entertainment platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain strong relationships with key partners, including media organizations, content creators, platforms, and production companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide guidance and mentorship to a team of content and creative strategists, fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless integration of content strategy into broader marketing and communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and implement measurement frameworks to assess the effectiveness of content campaigns and optimize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Translate brand objectives into actionable content strategies that drive measurable business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;

