rosoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, Power Point).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with content management systems (CMS) and social media&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open &lt;/strong&gt;environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;Message Body&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Job Description&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;This role reports to: Head, Analytics, MD&amp;amp;O&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 best things about the job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Handling confidential data, providing inputs/guidance to C-suite on decisions that directly impact org strategy &amp;amp; profitability&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Immense learning opportunities, freedom to ask the right questions and question answers&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Something new every day: wide variety in nature of work requests involving both market &amp;amp; org data – tracking key business deliverables, analyzing market developments (e.g. impact of Disney-Reliance merger, NTO), establishing frameworks (digital IO inflation, prop media benchmarks), tracking media publisher revenue, analyzing viewership/audience trends, etc.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, your goals will be:&lt;br&gt;In three months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Understand the org structure, workflow between WPPM, portfolios and other BUs, your role and set KPIs in discussion with your manager&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Get familiar with reports produced by the team and your SOW&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Ensure that VLOOKUP&#39;s /classification/mapping are maintained properly (i.e. are accurate and updated regularly)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In six months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Review &amp;amp; supervise the team’s tasks &amp;amp; deliverables; ensure 100% data accuracy &amp;amp; 100% adherence to timelines on critical deliverables&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Understand how the different types of data maintained by Analytics finds application in company strategy; understand the inter-relations between data&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 12 months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Work independently on tasks, ad-hoc requests without manager’s support&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Anticipate problems/issues on the above, think about additional perspectives that may be useful and build it into the solution/deck&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Stay updated with industry trends: economy, regulation, media, tech, consumer (audience) trends, etc.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Combine the above to create top quality work: i.e. work that has considered available data, covered all perspectives, triangulated different data points to ratify results (data interpretation/insights) and has attempted to answer as many questions as possible&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What your day job looks like with Team Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Reviewing steps followed by the team in data cleaning, compiling &amp;amp; checking – help the team develop logic checks&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Working on benchmarks: applying the right logic to arrive at appropriate benchmarks, using market trends/intelligence/other data sources to inform the logic&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Inflation: review market &amp;amp; WPPM inflation data to assess YTD inflation&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Track key buying metrics, develop new reports/dashboards&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Work on short reads/whitepapers that clearly outline the impact of developments in tech/regulatory/consumer behavior on media, and therefore WPPM&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Skill and will! And humility. And a sense of humor, if possible.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Strong logical thinking + strong inclination to question given wisdom, assumptions – the most important criterion&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Meticulous attention to detail: catching errors in numbers/data &amp;amp; faulty logic, ability to check one’s own work &amp;amp; of the team’s&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Willingness to go beyond the immediate task: asking the ‘so what’ question
- how the data insight impacts the bigger picture&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Comfortable leading a team who may be from very different backgrounds&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;

MINIMUM

QUALIFICATIONS:

&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Graduate degree&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;10 years + of full-time media planning work experience dominated by TV but with good understanding of Print, Radio &amp;amp; Digital – preferred, but not a deal-breaker&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Strong numerical skills&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Good communication: correct grammar, succinct sentences – yes, it’s a deal breaker&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Excel &amp;amp; Power Point: should be comfortable using formulae and working on ppts
- mandatory&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li class=&quot;x_Mso Normal&quot;&gt;Proficiency in use of media applications (BMW,BARC/YUMI, Radio Audience Measurement)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;#LI PROMOTED&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;Normal Text Run SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
